932	{"artifactId":"LLD-b7a68147dcf72034-s2","entry":{"id":"68c80a0203364a049b06a3cdc21ef690","actor":{"id":"insrc:approval","kind":"system","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-23T10:58:57.502Z","operation":"approve","revision":{"number":3,"contentHash":"4517d71cfa992027de9df06f591362e78a9bcfb54abcd348c25eda5245ad0076"},"status":{"from":"draft","to":"approved"},"outcome":{"result":"override","summary":"Daemon review rounds 1-3 all blocked (1 HIGH + 4 MED; 1 MED; 2 MED, 0 HIGH in round 3). Rounds 1 and 2 were fixed in the LLD. The two round-3 findings are captured as binding requirements R1 (completeStructured with internalRetry false and maxAttempts 1, exact 2+2 call test) and R2 (sc2 and sc3 refinements, amendments filed in the s3 run) in docs/plans/tool-registry.md, to be carried by the s2 plan and build. The DEF S002 FR001/FR004 narrowing rests on the recorded decision in the same file. User approved with override."}}}
